repository-code: "https://github.com/vicvalentim/ziviDomeLive"
abstract: >
  ziviDomeLive is a Java library for Processing for real-time fulldome, spherical
  and immersive visual workflows. It provides a scene lifecycle, Standard and
  spherical rendering domains, Domemaster, Equirectangular and Skybox
  representations, calibration controls, and optional NDI, Syphon or Spout
  output routing.
